      "purpose": "Remote ingest observes all/ext/id input scope where applicable."
    }
  ],
  "prose": {
    "summary": "Define ingest as parse→map→transform→schema validate→quality validate→authorize→write, with candidate data inert until all required acceptance gates succeed.",
